      {
        "id": 225804,
        "name": "Braithwhite",
        "username": "Braithwhite",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/{size}/1854_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-20T04:21:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m so happy that the digital version is out, because I’ve been waiting to see the dialog threads for a while! &nbsp;Here is what you’ve got in store:</p>\n<p>1. Oblivaeon says a unique phrase to each hero, though it is the same across all variants of that hero.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2. EACH variant says something different in response. Have fun with that! &nbsp;DW Setback, Extreme AA, and&nbsp;The Harpy are my favorites!</p>\n<p>But wait, there’s more!</p>\n<p>3. Villains with heroic alternates &nbsp;(and their heroic counterparts) have unique dialog (which changes with the variants for either villain or hero).&nbsp; This also includes V5 style villains where appropriate (baron blade/bomber blade/Vengeance Blade, for instance, each have unique lines for every Legacy Variant as well as for Luminary and Heroic Luminary)</p>\n<p>4. &nbsp;the Matriarch/Harpy interactions are my favorites. &nbsp;Not so much an added thing, really. Not sure it deserved a separate number.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hope you all have fun finding them all!</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:32.405Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
