        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I’m so happy that the digital version is out, because I’ve been waiting to see the dialog threads for a while! &nbsp;Here is what you’ve got in store:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Oblivaeon says a unique phrase to each hero, though it is the same across all variants of that hero.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. EACH variant says something different in response. Have fun with that! &nbsp;DW Setback, Extreme AA, and&nbsp;The Harpy are my favorites!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But wait, there’s more!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Villains with heroic alternates &nbsp;(and their heroic counterparts) have unique dialog (which changes with the variants for either villain or hero).&nbsp; This also includes V5 style villains where appropriate (baron blade/bomber blade/Vengeance Blade, for instance, each have unique lines for every Legacy Variant as well as for Luminary and Heroic Luminary)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. &nbsp;the Matriarch/Harpy interactions are my favorites. &nbsp;Not so much an added thing, really. Not sure it deserved a separate number.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hope you all have fun finding them all!</p>",
